  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2598e857b284925a344cfeb3fb12f50, type: 3}
  m_Name: Linh_CityIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: LINH
  portrait: {fileID: -1297769870653861099, guid: b2dcf0c911c6cdd4ea996aa2005d4ebb, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: Enter c to continue
  closePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng"
  lines:
  - english: This is Linh. I work for the National Security Bureau.
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i l\xE0 Linh. T\xF4i l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c cho C\u1EE5c An ninh
      Qu\u1ED1c gia."
  - english: 'I need your help. After the earthquake, strange creatures and objects
      appeared in the city.

'
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i c\u1EA7n anh gi\xFAp. Sau tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EA5t,
      nh\u1EEFng sinh v\u1EADt v\xE0 v\u1EADt th\u1EC3 l\u1EA1 xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n
      trong th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1."
  - english: The creatures are attacking people in the streets and destroying buildings.
    vietnamese: "Nh\u1EEFng sinh v\u1EADt \u0111\xF3 \u0111ang t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      d\xE2n tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\u1ED1 v\xE0 ph\xE1 h\u1EE7y c\xE1c t\xF2a
      nh\xE0."
  - english: We need your help to save them. But first, please check something for
      us.
    vietnamese: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u1EA7n anh gi\xFAp gi\u1EA3i c\u1EE9u h\u1ECD.
      Nh\u01B0ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn, h\xE3y ki\u1EC3m tra m\u1ED9t th\u1EE9
      gi\xFAp ch\xFAng t\xF4i."
  - english: Go to the city park. An ancient tower appeared there after the earthquake.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y \u0111\u1EBFn c\xF4ng vi\xEAn th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1. M\u1ED9t
      t\xF2a th\xE1p c\u1ED5 \u0111\xE3 xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF \u0111\xF3 sau
      tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EA5t."
  - english: We do not know where it came from. The creatures stay away from it.
    vietnamese: "Ch\xFAng ta ch\u01B0a bi\u1EBFt n\xF3 t\u1EEB \u0111\xE2u \u0111\u1EBFn.
      Nh\u1EEFng sinh v\u1EADt kia tr\xE1nh xa n\xF3."
  - english: Find the tower and check it. If you find any items inside, take them
      with you. They may help us.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y t\xECm v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m tra t\xF2a th\xE1p. N\u1EBFu t\xECm
      th\u1EA5y v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m b\xEAn trong, h\xE3y mang ch\xFAng theo. Ch\xFAng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 gi\xFAp ch\xFAng ta."
  - english: Check your map to find the entrance to the park. Follow the road and
      watch out for monsters.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y xem b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm l\u1ED1i v\xE0o
      c\xF4ng vi\xEAn. \u0110i theo con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xE0 \u0111\u1EC1 ph\xF2ng
      qu\xE1i v\u1EADt."
  - english: Be careful. Call me when you reach the tower.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn. Li\xEAn l\u1EA1c v\u1EDBi t\xF4i khi
      anh \u0111\u1EBFn t\xF2a th\xE1p."
